  liver enzymes and bilirubin may occur. Rhabdomyolysis has been reported. Safety and
  effectiveness in neonates have not been established as lipid-based formulations may have
  reduced tissue penetration as compared with conventional formulations in neonates. See
  Conventional Amphotericin B for drug interactions.
