  occur. Pulmonary hypertension in newborns/infants treated for hypoglycemia (especially at
  doses ≥10 mg/kg/24 hr) has been reported, and resolution/improvement of the condition
  was achieved after discontinuing diazoxide. Monitor BP closely for hypotension. Diazoxide
