        dose range: 20–30 mg/24 hr. There is very minimal experience with doses >20 mg/24 hr and no
        experience with doses >60 mg/24 hr.
     Higher-weight child and adolescent: Start at 10 mg PO once daily and increase dose to 20 mg/24 hr
        after 2 wk. May further increase dose after several weeks. Usual dose range: 20–60 mg/24 hr;
        higher dose of 80 mg/24 hr has been reported.
