   Tourette syndrome, rash, appetite suppression/weight loss, growth suppression, dizziness,
   xerostomia, and GI disturbances. Dermatillomania, bruxism, intestinal ischemia, Stevens-
   Johnson syndrome, and TEN have been reported.


