Contraindicated in hypersensitivity and history of angioedema with other ACE inhibitors and
  in combination with a neprilysin inhibitor (e.g., sacubitril). Do not use with aliskiren in
  patients with diabetes. Avoid use with dialysis with high-flux membranes because
