Contraindicated in patients sensitive to carbapenems, or with a history of anaphylaxis to β-
  lactam antibiotics. Use with caution in meningitis and CNS disorders (may cause seizures)
  and renal impairment (adjust dose; see Chapter 32). Drug penetrates well into the CSF.
