  abuse in combination with benzodiazepines. Serotonin syndrome has been reported with
  use with selective serotonin reuptake inhibitors (SSRIs), serotonin norepinephrine
  reuptake inhibitor (SNRIs), TCAs, 5-HT3 antagonists, MAO inhibitors, and drugs that
  affect the serotonergic neurotransmitter system (e.g., trazodone, tramadol). Methadone




