Contraindicated in Cockayne syndrome as fatal liver failure has been reported. Avoid use in
  first-trimester pregnancy. Use with caution in patients with CNS disease, blood dyscrasias,
  severe liver (reduce dose by 50% with Child-Pugh class C) or renal disease (GFR <10 mL/




