Common side effects include orthostatic hypotension, peripheral edema, hypercholesterolemia,
   hyperprolactinemia, appetite simulation, weight gain (greater in adolescents than adults;
   monitoring is recommended), hypertriglyceridemia, constipation, xerostomia, akathisia,
