   depression. Caution is also indicated with anticholinergic agents (e.g., azelastine,
   glycopyrrolate), as olanzapine may enhance the anticholinergic effects. Use with Q–Tc-
   prolonging medications may further increase the risk for Q–Tc prolongation.




