  may increase prothrombin time. Inhibits the cytochrome P-450 (CYP) 2D6 drug-
  metabolizing enzyme. Serotonin syndrome may occur when taken with selective serotonin
  reuptake inhibitors (e.g., amitriptyline, amphetamines, buspirone, dihydroergotamine,
