  those receiving aminoglycosides, phenothiazines, quinidine, β-blockers, amphotericin
  B, cyclophosphamide, diuretics, lithium, acetylcholine, and anticholinesterases.
  Diazepam may decrease neuromuscular blocking effects. Prior use of succinylcholine
  may enhance the neuromuscular blocking effect of vecuronium and its duration of
  action.
Duration of action 4–6 min IV, 10–30 min IM. Must be prepared to intubate within 1 min.
