Respiratory distress syndrome (RDS):
  Rescue therapy (treatment; see remarks): 3 mL/kg/dose intratracheally immediately after
    the diagnosis of RDS. May repeat dose as needed Q12 hr to max. of 3 doses total.
  Prophylactic therapy (without antenatal steroid use; see remarks): 3 mL/kg/dose
