The following therapeutic trough level recommendations are based on the assumption that the
  pathogen’s vancomycin minimum inhibitory concentration (MIC) is ≤1 mg/L.

  Indication                                                                        Goal Trough Level
  Uncomplicated skin and soft tissue infection, uncomplicated bacteremia,           10–14 mg/L
    febrile neutropenia, sepsis
